abstract: >-
  A reproducible experimental laboratory for modern neural-network mechanisms.
  Each architecture track carries a mathematical specification, invariant tests,
  matched-budget baselines, ablations, machine-readable experiment records, and a
  report whose claim level is bounded by an explicit claim policy.
